1
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:10,780
No... impossible.

2
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:13,300
You're clearly just a frail addict to Five Stone Powder.

3
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:14,580
How could you...

4
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,560
How could you escape his surveillance?

5
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:20,720
And even dare to defy your master, right?

6
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,000
Impossible.

7
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:26,160
Too bad you'll never have the chance...

8
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:29,200
To report back anymore.

9
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,800
I'm acting under the orders of the Third Prince.

10
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:32,600
The prince is going against his own brother?

11
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,560
You better think through the consequences.

12
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:41,280
Zhu Huaichen.

13
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,960
I'll take your life sooner or later.

14
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:46,120
What? You want to kill him?

15
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,600
Hand over the whereabouts of the Dragon Jade.

16
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,400
And I'll spare your life.

17
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:08,480
I only blame myself for being soft-hearted at the time.

18
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,560
And even marrying An'er to you.

19
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,280
Tch.

20
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:15,440
Elder brother, wait!

21
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,280
Calm down.

22
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,920
Let me, your humble younger brother, help you question this General Li thoroughly.

23
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:22,480
The whereabouts of the Dragon Jade.

24
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:47,840
General, dying won’t be that easy for you.

25
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,760
If you don’t talk,

26
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:52,280
I’ll use every single torture device in this prison on you.

27
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:56,840
One by one,

28
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,880
I’ve spent my life on the battlefield,

29
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:01,400
How could I yield to your threats?

30
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,840
Take your time.

31
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:09,040
Whoever finds out the whereabouts of the Dragon Jade,

32
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,720
will be generously rewarded by me.

33
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:12,800
Someone! Return to the manor!

34
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:28,800
Zhi An,

35
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,400
sorry to keep you waiting.

36
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:54,520
Zhu Huaichen, Duan Yurou,

37
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:57,760
I’m curious to see what tricks you’re up to this time.

38
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:09,040
Zhi An,

39
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,120
you look stunning today.

40
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:19,880
What’s wrong?

41
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,120
It’s nothing.

42
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:37,640
Zhi An,

43
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,080
let’s drink the wedding wine, shall we?

44
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,400
So, this is my wedding night?

45
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,920
So disgusting.

46
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:21,520
Zhi'an, you shouldn't have to face all this.

47
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,800
Assassin!

48
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,320
Huaichen, what happened?

49
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:43,280
Huaichen, is there a third person in this room besides us?

50
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:44,800
You're overthinking it.

51
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,720
Apart from you and me,

52
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,320
there's no one else here.

53
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:49,760
Guards!

54
00:05:49,760 --> 00:05:50,800
There's an assassin!

55
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,120
Third Prince!

56
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:04,080
What happened?

57
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,680
Third Prince, what happened?

58
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:08,520
His eyes have been injured! Quickly, summon the imperial physician!

59
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:09,040
Hurry!

60
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:09,760
Quick, treat the prince!

61
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:12,120
Leave, and capture the assassin!

62
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:14,160
Yes, capture the assassin!

63
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:16,000
Why is Huaichen so enraged?

64
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,800
Are you resenting me?

65
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,240
How could I?

66
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,840
Today is, after all, our big day.

67
00:06:24,940 --> 00:06:26,860
Wait here for me to return.

68
00:06:35,820 --> 00:06:37,740
Could it be that her eyesight has been restored?

69
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:44,660
Zhu Huaichen!

70
00:06:45,420 --> 00:06:46,980
Enjoy this moment.

71
00:06:47,940 --> 00:06:51,420
Your suffering has just begun.
